1xx Informational
100 Continue: The server got the first part of the request.
102 Processing: The server is working on the request.

2xx Success Codes
200 OK: The request worked.
201 Created: A new item was made.
202 Accepted: The request is processing.
204 No Content: The request worked, but there is no data to send back.

3xx Redirection Codes
301 Moved Permanently: The page has a new address for good.
302 Found: The page is at a new address for now.
304 Not Modified: The cached version is still good to use.

4xx Client Error Codes
400 Bad Request: The server could not understand the request.
401 Unauthorized: You need to log in first.
403 Forbidden: You do not have permission to view this.
404 Not Found: The page or item does not exist.
409 Conflict: The item already exists or clashes.
422 Unprocessable Entity: Valid JSON, but bad business rules.
429 Too Many Requests: You are sending too many requests too fast.

5xx Server Error Code
500 Internal Server Error: Something went wrong on the server.
502 Bad Gateway: Bad response from an upstream server.
503 Service Unavailable: Server is down or busy.
504 Gateway Timeout: The upstream server took too long.